name: Verity gates
# Rendered by the Verity localhost act runner (stage 87, ADR-0030) from the
# committed single-source gate definition `.verity/gates.json` at {{sha}} —
# generated into a temp directory for ONE run and discarded, never committed,
# never hand-edited. Workflow YAML is NOT an independent source of gate truth
# (ADR-0030): every step below replays one committed gate, in order, judged by
# exit code only (ADR-0028).
#
# Gate commands must not depend on GitHub-only context (API calls,
# secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN, gitleaks-action-style steps) — the definition must
# stay runnable on every runner (ADR-0030 Consequences); a command that does
# fails honestly under act.
on: push
jobs:
  gates:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
{{steps}}
